# __FIA_DISPLAY_NAME__

This FIA application uses a React UI and an application-specific Swift backend.

```bash
bun install
bun run dev
bun run build
bun run run
```

`src/ui/` contains the browser UI. `Backend/` is a SwiftPM executable package that imports the
`FIABackend` SDK shipped by `@semicoder/fia`. Calls use `@semicoder/fia/backend`; desktop window and
status bar commands continue to use `@semicoder/fia/native`.

During `bun run dev`, React updates with HMR and successful Swift builds restart only the backend.
Production packages static UI resources and `fia-backend`; it does not contain the Bun runtime.
